probably more so than just about anything else), {lo} terms are neutral bet=
ween=20
the distributive and collective senses (the word "mass" generates a whole n=
other=20
set of problems from Logjam history).  Using it as both in a single sentenc=
e=20
seems wrong when you think about it, but perfectly natural in use: "The stu=
dents=20
wore green headbands and surrounded the building.". "The girls dressed like=
 Lady=20
