hem=20
is that (abc)=3D((ab)c)=3D(a(bc))=3D(b(ac))=3D((abc)), so, there is no part=
icular=20
problem in the same things constituting a pamei, a remei and a cimei. it's =
all=20
in how you (mentally or not) group them.  And so, of course, is the matter =
